["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だって</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">助词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">助詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毕竟；因为；但是；可是；连；甚至；也；同样；而且；据说；听说；你是说</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168676\"><ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にだってそんな<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かるよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Even children can understand it.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥当</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">妥当</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">妥</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だぶだぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宽松；肥大；松弛；下垂；溅洒；泼溅；溢出；（液体）充裕地；大量地浸泡（如浸在酱汁中）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92147\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はだぶだぶの<ruby>上着<rp>(</rp><rt>うわぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She&#x27;s wearing a loose coat.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ダブる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">重复；重叠；重叠；撞期；同时发生；留级；重修（不及格的课程或学年）；完成双杀；双误（网球）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170291\"><ruby>祭日<rp>(</rp><rt>さいじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>日曜<rp>(</rp><rt>にちよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にダブると<ruby>月曜<rp>(</rp><rt>げつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When a holiday falls on Sunday, we have an extra holiday on Monday.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ダブル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">双倍；两倍；双人床；带双人床的酒店客房；双排扣的；双叠袖口的；双幅宽（布料；通常为1.42米）；双打；（少用）混血儿（尤指父母一方为日本人者）；父母族裔不同的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203363\">ダブルのバスつきの<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;d like a double with a bath.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だます</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">欺骗；欺诈；蒙骗；诈骗；哄劝；安抚；平复</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92655\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はセールスマンにだまされた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She was taken in by the salesman.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黙る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沉默；保持沉默；不说话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194471\">もうこれ<ruby>以上<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>黙<rp>(</rp><rt>だま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってられないわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I can no longer remain silent.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ダム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大坝；堤坝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137673\"><ruby>大雨<rp>(</rp><rt>おおあめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のためにダムが<ruby>決壊<rp>(</rp><rt>けっかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The dam burst owing to the heavy rain.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だめ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不好；没用；坏掉的；失效的；没希望；徒劳；白费；无意义；不可以；不能；不允许；（围棋）双方均不占有的交叉点；公空；不行！；停！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75261\">もうだめだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s all over.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だらけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">充满；到处都是；满是（如错误）；被...覆盖；沾满（血、泥等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><spa